# PSR-9b — Scorecard collectors expand

## Intent

Add SoT-aligned collectors that PSR-9a deferred:

| Metric | Collector |
| --- | --- |
| Dirty worktree records | `git status --porcelain` line count |
| Absolute local doc links | `/home/…` + `/Users/…` hits under `docs/**/*.{md,mdoc}` |
| Denali `package.json` exports map size | `exports` key count |
| Governance trio present | LICENSE + SECURITY.md + CONTRIBUTING.md (0–3) |
| Harbor tier stub honesty | `1` while `productionTier=stub` (interim; flips when certified) |

Still **measure-only** — never claims PSR-9 / program closed.

## Commands

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-9-closure-scorecard-collect.mjs \
  --scorecard docs/audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-9b-closure-scorecard.yaml
node scripts/ops/psr-9b-closure-scorecard-smoke.mjs
```

Default collector scorecard (when `--scorecard` omitted) is now the **9b** file.

## Honesty

- Dirty count includes intentional WIP; release closure requires clean SHA separately.
- Denali export count is `package.json#exports` keys — not public API surface review.
- `harbor_stub_honest=1` is a **holding** metric until durable recert (PSR-6c6 YES).

## Next

`PSR-8b-legacy-import-ratchet` or Architect YES/accept packs (`PSR-6c6`, `PSR-7d1`).
